        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo01_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "Keeping a close eye on me?",
          "duration": 2.024
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Silver",
          "audioFile": "werewolf_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/werewolf_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "Seven, I don't do my job out of a sense of justice. I do it to pay rent. And if we win today, that won't be a problem anymore. So trust me, I got no problem working with you if it means we win.",
          "duration": 11.589
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "seven_silver_convo02",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Silver",
          "audioFile": "werewolf_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo02_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/werewolf_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo02_01.mp3",
          "text": "So should I be worried that you were sloppy enough to end up in Lost Whisper? Or glad that you're competent enough to escape?",
          "duration": 7.511
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo02_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo02_02.mp3",
          "text": "How charming.  What are you planning on asking the Patron for, Silver?  A new liver?",
          "duration": 6.456
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "seven_silver_convo03",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_01.mp3",
          "text": "How long are you going to squander your talents?",
          "duration": 2.881
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Silver",
          "audioFile": "werewolf_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/werewolf_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_02.mp3",
          "text": "You don't know me, Seven.",
          "duration": 1.579
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_03.mp3",
          "text": "I know the clich\u00e9 you are all-to keen to wrap yourself in.  You're worse than a petulant teenager\u2026 at least they have the excuse that their brains aren't fully formed.",
          "duration": 10.887
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Silver",
          "audioFile": "werewolf_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/werewolf_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_04.mp3",
          "text": "Hell of a pep talk, Dad.",
          "duration": 1.619
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_05.mp3",
          "text": "You don't know your dad.",
          "duration": 1.826
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
